WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.360
Welcome to ReceiptNest.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:06.505
Snap a receipt, let us organize it, and download it whenever

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:07.340
you need it.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.020
On your dashboard, choose Add Receipt.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.900
On your phone, tap the plus button.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.305
Use Scan Receipt for paper, or Upload Existing File for a photo

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:17.960
or PDF.

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.680
Choose your file, check the preview, and tap Process Receipt.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:27.825
ReceiptNest reads the merchant, amount, and date, adds a

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.460
category, and saves everything automatically.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.960
For most receipts, that's it.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.000
No typing or routine confirmation.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:38.240
You can edit details or add a note anytime.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:42.525
If a receipt is marked Needs Review, check it and choose

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.620
Confirm and Save.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.300
To find a receipt later, search by merchant, amount, or date,

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:50.660
then open the result.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:54.325
Choose Download below Original Receipt to save the file you

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:54.640
uploaded.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.000
Need a whole month?

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:58.440
Find it on your dashboard and open its Download menu.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.405
Choose CSV for a spreadsheet with your receipt details and a

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:02.820
total.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:06.180
Choose PDF for your receipt documents in one file.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.560
PDF exports are a Pro feature.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.045
For emailed receipts, copy your personal ReceiptNest address

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:14.300
from the dashboard and forward them there.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.520
They'll be processed automatically too.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:17.640
That's it.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.240
Snap, organize, download.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.360
Start with one receipt today.
